---
// Draft for owner review. Not legal advice; have counsel read it.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Transparency - Paul Ann Labs"
  description="How Paul Ann Labs makes money, how it uses AI, and what it will and won't claim."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Transparency</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate">Who we are, how we get paid, how we use AI, and what we won't claim.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate">Effective November 1, 2026.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">Who we are</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">Paul Ann Labs deploys AI inside a business, beside the systems it already runs. It is a Trimmie Holdings company. Paul Ann Media is our sister company, and HomeTimeJobs is a product of the family.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">What we can and can't claim</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">Where a paper describes a deployment, it describes one operating layer in production, with identifying detail removed. We would rather say that than imply a breadth of deployment we do not have. Illustrations are marked as illustrations and hypotheticals as hypotheticals. Where an outcome is stated, it is directional.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">How we get paid</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">By our clients. Phase One is a monthly retainer, and our published prices are on the <a href="/methodology/" class="font-semibold text-fig-ink hover:underline">methodology page</a>. Nobody pays us to recommend software, a vendor or a model. If that ever changes, we will say so where the recommendation appears.</p>

    <h2 id="ai" class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">How we use AI</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-slate">
      <li>We use AI tools to help us research, write, design and make images. A person reviews everything before it is published, and we stand behind it as our own work.</li>
      <li>The photos on this site are AI-generated illustrations. The people and places in them are not real customers, workers or shops.</li>
      <li>The intelligence layer we build reports and recommends. People in your business decide.</li>
      <li>We don't use what you send us through this site to train AI models.</li>
      <li>Our pages are open to AI search tools (see robots.txt and llms.txt) so they can describe us accurately.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">Your data</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">Your data stays yours. We don't use one client's data for another client or to train AI models, and we put what the layer may read, and who can see it, in writing before we start.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-2xl font-bold">Questions</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">Ask through the form on our <a href="/privacy/#contact" class="font-semibold text-fig-ink hover:underline">privacy page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
